restrict spellcasting, nor does any of the standard "ascension kit" (any
magic boots that aren't kicking, non-metal gauntlets (dex or leather, 
doesn't matter), helm of brilliance, cloak of whatever.

Have you ascended a Wizard before?  If not, I suggest you do so and then
